<rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>some.pics (中文)</title><link>https://some.pics</link><description>只是网上的一些图片。</description><language>zh-CN</language><lastBuildDate>Thu, 10 Sep 2026 20:58:05 +0000</lastBuildDate><item><title>Lochby 日志 1</title><link>https://some.pics/6aa319da6cd5a</link><description>&lt;p&gt;Lochby 日志 1&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Lochby Journal 1" height="480" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/sinistergrackle/6aa319da6cd5a.png" width="400"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://sinistergrackle.some.pics"&gt;@sinistergrackle&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 10 Sep 2026 20:58:05 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>沿着今天的路</title><link>https://some.pics/6aa2f6fe7c7b3</link><description>&lt;p&gt;沿着今天的路&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Über eine grüne Fläche runter auf einen blauen Fjord, umgeben von Wald bedeckten Höhenzüge, schauend. Der Himmel ist so gut wie wolkenlos und rechts oben sieht man Teile der Sonne. Looking down across a green patch onto a blue fjord, surrounded by forest-covered hills. The sky is virtually cloudless and you can see parts of the sun in the top right-hand corner. " height="2688" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/roteskuffen/6aa2f6fe7c7b3.jpg" width="4000"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://roteskuffen.some.pics"&gt;@roteskuffen&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 10 Sep 2026 18:29:22 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>在阿尔加维度过一个阳光明媚的美好日子。</title><link>https://some.pics/6aa2f0db9bcb8</link><description>&lt;p&gt;在阿尔加维度过一个阳光明媚的美好日子。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="A photo taken at a marina in Portugal. The sky is blue and clear of clouds. The photo is straight down a waterway with many boats docked on either side. In the distance are even more boats and a huge, white hotel." height="3907" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/tristy/6aa2f0db9bcb8.jpg" width="2925"/&gt;&l